      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can see this list has optional MSRs, but not sure if pKVM mandates those(for eg: `MSR_IA32_TSX_CTRL`)? If not, I think this BUG_ON might fire on hardware which doesn\u0027t support it. I can see `vmx_setup_user_return_msrs` attempts to register each of the MSRs through `kvm_add_user_return_msr` -\u003e `kvm_probe_user_return_msr` but ignore the probe error and hence `kvm_uret_msrs_list` might not be populated with optional MSRs. A host could issue wrmsr for unavailable MSRs which would trigger this BUG_ON right?",
