      "message": "Indeed...\n\nMy first thought was that it would be cleaner to enable interception of these MSRs dynamically later, during pkvm_init, after we initialized `kvm_uret_msrs_list`, so that we can enable it precisely for those and only those MSRs that are in `kvm_uret_msrs_list`.\n\nBut since the host should not normally be using unsupported MSRs anyway, it seems ok to unconditionally intercept them all and just silently proceed to `wrmsr_safe()` here if `slot \u003c 0`.",
